<p>Every item of the earlier page of skill drafts landed. The last two of its commits were <code>f898915bc</code>, which landed version 10 at 11:15 UTC on 5 November, and <code>8fa68948f</code>, which fixed its cold read's flags at 11:23. This page starts the history afresh, at your word.</p>
