</div></div>
<div class="note"><p><strong>Why.</strong> It came in at commit <code>f1dff89b4</code>, by the coordinator's decision on flag F3. Step 7 asked for the old words struck through, while “Pages” asked for a collapsed current text, which after a landing is the new text. A worker briefed from both could not tell which rule wins. This changes the reading of 11:53 that “Pages” stays as it is.</p></div>
</section>

<section id="l4" class="part item">
