<ul><li><span class="add"><code>SKILL.md</code>, “The curator's role and decisions”, the report bullet: after a change lands, a worker updates the page of skill drafts, and the chat gives one line and the page's link; a reversal may come by a comment on the change's item. The waiting bullet: its item goes under the page's proposed changes.</span></li><li><span class="add"><code>skill-rewrite.md</code>, “The method”, step 7: the page's two sections, the landed changes of the last landing as diffs with their reasons, and the proposed changes; the bullet after the steps points to step 7. POSITIONS changes stay reported in chat (“Quiet times”), and “Pages” stays as it is, the struck-through words being its marking of a change.</span></li></ul>
